30E6 B7FF01           (     shanghai.asm):03792          STA  $FF01  AND PUT IT BACK
30E9 B6FF03           (     shanghai.asm):03793          LDA  $FF03  GET MSB OF JOY/AUDIO
30EC 84F7             (     shanghai.asm):03794          ANDA #$FF-8 PORT AND RESET IT TOO
30EE B7FF03           (     shanghai.asm):03795          STA  $FF03  AND PUT IT BACK
